<title>USA: Moore Products again omits dividend.</title>
<headline>Moore Products again omits dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SPRING HOUSE, Pa. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moore Products Co said directors again declared there would be no dividend on the common stock.</p>
<p>The company last paid $0.06 per share on March 1, 1993.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
